</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Just one touch! and He makes me whole,</l><l>Speaks sweet peace to my sin-sick soul,</l><l>At His feet all my burdens roll,</l><l>Cured by the Healer divine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Just one touch! and the work is done,</l><l>I am cured by the blessed Son,</l><l>I will sing while the ages run,</l><l>Cured by the Healer divine.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Just one touch! and He turns to me,</l><l>O the love in His eyes I see!</l><l>I am His for He hears my plea,</l><l>Cured by the Healer divine.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Just one touch! by His mighty power</l><l>He can heal thee this very hour,</l><l>Thou canst hear though the tempests low’r,</l><l>Cured by the Healer divine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
